WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.350 --> 00:00:04.770
Let me show you something I saw the other
day.

00:00:04.770 --> 00:00:08.300
This is the new Irish Prime Minister – the
Taoiseach

00:00:08.300 --> 00:00:12.760
…trying to impress his Canadian colleague
on a state visit.

00:00:12.760 --> 00:00:14.800
Anything catch your attention?

00:00:18.540 --> 00:00:22.540
That made me think: 'We must talk about socks.'

00:00:22.540 --> 00:00:26.130
So much goes wrong
…in that department.

00:00:26.130 --> 00:00:29.170
You see socks are not there to keep your feet
warm.

00:00:29.170 --> 00:00:32.660
They're there to keep your legs out of sight.

00:00:33.580 --> 00:00:36.300
Rule number one:
Your socks must be long enough.

00:00:36.300 --> 00:00:42.629
Even when you're sitting down
…your bare legs can NEVER be exposed.

00:00:42.629 --> 00:00:44.249
Rule number two – color.

00:00:44.249 --> 00:00:46.590
Your socks should match your trousers.

00:00:46.590 --> 00:00:47.590
Not your shoes.

00:00:47.590 --> 00:00:49.149
Number three: Keep it simple.

00:00:49.149 --> 00:00:50.800
Plain is best.

00:00:50.800 --> 00:00:53.319
Striped Dotted Checked
Also possible.

00:00:53.320 --> 00:00:56.900
Even bright, garish colors can work.

00:00:59.080 --> 00:01:00.760
But that's pretty advanced stuff.

00:01:00.769 --> 00:01:05.000
Which brings me to rule number four.

00:01:05.000 --> 00:01:06.870
Novelty socks.

00:01:07.760 --> 00:01:08.820
You know.

00:01:08.830 --> 00:01:10.320
Mickey Mouse.

00:01:10.320 --> 00:01:11.320
Dollar signs.

00:01:11.320 --> 00:01:12.549
National flags.

00:01:12.549 --> 00:01:13.550
The funny stuff.

00:01:13.550 --> 00:01:17.240
What Mum gave you for Christmas
…in 1995.

00:01:18.670 --> 00:01:20.780
Don't do it.

00:01:20.790 --> 00:01:21.810
Ever.

00:01:21.810 --> 00:01:22.829
Period.

00:01:22.829 --> 00:01:26.880
'But what' – I hear you cry
…'what about Batman socks?'

00:01:28.420 --> 00:01:30.979
And yes, of course, that's the exception.

00:01:30.979 --> 00:01:33.090
Batman socks are OK.

00:01:33.090 --> 00:01:36.450
But only if you actually are…

00:01:36.450 --> 00:01:37.920
Batman.

00:01:40.220 --> 00:01:42.620
Oh, you're not Batman?

00:01:42.620 --> 00:01:43.800
Rule number four applies.

